WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,020
Hope they find nothing

2
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:08,170
There's something black outside the Olivier Award

3
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:09,810
Sooner or later they will find out

4
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:11,290
The team moves forward slowly

5
00:00:11,530 --> 00:00:12,850
Waiting for the first batch of investigation results

6
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:21,620
So many living beings without the Golden River can still fly

7
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:26,810
It turned out to be the base's reconnaissance team

8
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:29,630
Cui Zixuan and Du Ling know the rules

9
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:31,430
How dare you bring someone to find me?
